<title>UK: AUSTRALIAN/N.Z. WOOL PRICES FOR JULY.</title>
<headline>AUSTRALIAN/N.Z. WOOL PRICES FOR JULY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commonwealth Secretariat estimated Australian and New Zealand wool prices for July 1997 as follows, in pence per kilo clean, cif UK dry-combed.</p>
<p>   70s 511	  64s 407	  60s 312	  58s 290</p>
<p>   56s 272	  50s 236	  48s 219	  46s 188</p>
<p>Prices are based on quotations from sales in Australia and New Zealand and represent unweighted average for super, good and average fleeces and skirting (free and light burry). Quotes for 56s and coarser are confined to New Zealand wools.</p>
</text>
